# BERLIN's pages: every button and its presses, each page's knobs as the reader says them (one layout: a layer's main
# page K1 how much, K2 octave (the Drone: Reso; the Atmosphere: Width), K3 and K4 its own; its sound page brightness,
# envelope, Reverb, Echo), the voices on ALGORITHM, a knob turned, a layer's level on OCT+
wait 200
listen
wait 300
expect view 0
said Berlin page: Filter Off, Evolve 40, Motion 45, Drift
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 18
said Key page: Tempo 96, Root D, Mode Minor, Transpose Parallel
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
said Drone page, voice Organ: Pedal 70, Reso 0, Phaser 60, Attack 40
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 8
said Drone sound page, voice Organ: Colour 0, Release 50, Reverb 50, Echo 50
# (the filter motion) the layer's button once more: its Move page (Width, Time, Rate, Intro)
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 12
said Drone move page, voice Organ: Width
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
said Sequence page, voice 2600: Density 65, Octave 0, Length 16, Grid 16ths
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 9
said Seq sound page, voice 2600: Cutoff 45, Decay 35, Reverb 50, Echo 50
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 13
said Repeats page, voice 2600: Repeat A 100, A time 1/8., Repeat B 50, B time 1/4
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 23
said Seq move page, voice 2600: Width
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 3
said Lead page, voice Odyssey: Phrases 50, Octave 0, Glide 25, Vibrato 40
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 10
said Lead sound page, voice Odyssey: Tone 50, Attack 10, Reverb 90, Echo 90
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 14
said Lead move page, voice Odyssey: Width
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 4
said Sequence 2 page, voice Moog: Chance 100, Octave -1, Length 7, Level 60
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 11
said Seq2 sound page, voice Moog: Cutoff 40, Decay 35, Reverb 50, Echo 50
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 16
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 24
said Seq2 move page, voice Moog: Width
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 19
said Atmosphere page, character Wind: Density 0, Width 50, Drift 0, Air 0
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 21
said Atmos sound page, character Wind: Colour 0, Ring 50, Reverb 50, Echo 50
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 25
said Atmos move page, character Wind: Width
tap FX
wait 300
expect view 5
said Space page: Echo
tap FX
wait 300
expect view 20
said Echo page: Blur
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 6
said Setup page: Tune 0, MIDI out On
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 22
said Arc page: Lead in 32, Bridge 45, Arc 25
# a knob on the Arc page: its help line shown as it turns (the review: the Arc's row was missing, NULL)
turn K1 1
wait 300
said Lead in 33
turn K1 -1
wait 300
# the voices: ALGORITHM on a layer's page
tap ENV
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Strings
expect par22 1
tap LFO
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Mini
# a knob: its value said once it settles
tap ARP
wait 300
spin K3 -4
wait 300
said Length 12
expect par28 12
# a layer's level: OCT+ (5 a press)
expect par1 70
tap OCT+
wait 300
expect par1 75
# every page's knobs have a help line, BERLIN's, and each fits the rule
expect helpfit 0
